WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.047 --> 00:00:20.192
It was a gloomy day at the palace.

2
00:00:20.193 --> 00:00:26.785
The king yawned and rubbed his eyes.

3
00:00:26.785 --> 00:00:31.207
"I didn't sleep at all last night," he moaned.

4
00:00:31.207 --> 00:00:34.136
The king put his head in his hands.

5
00:00:34.136 --> 00:00:36.998
"I don't know what to do."

6
00:00:36.998 --> 00:00:39.164
The queen shook her head.

7
00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:42.671
"This must stop," she said.

8
00:00:42.671 --> 00:00:48.513
"I need my beauty sleep!"

9
00:00:48.513 --> 00:00:51.273
That night the king went to bed.

10
00:00:51.273 --> 00:00:54.319
A servant brought him a soft pillow.

11
00:00:54.319 --> 00:01:12.357
Cook brought him some warm milk.

12
00:01:12.357 --> 00:01:17.947
But the king tossed and turned again.

13
00:01:17.947 --> 00:01:20.552
The queen tried singing.

14
00:01:20.552 --> 00:01:25.726
"Go to sleep, my king!" she shrieked.

15
00:01:25.726 --> 00:01:30.317
He covered his ears with the soft pillow.

16
00:01:30.317 --> 00:01:38.045
Now he had a royal headache!

17
00:01:38.045 --> 00:01:41.612
The next morning the king stomped his foot.

18
00:01:41.612 --> 00:01:44.220
"Ouch!" cried the queen.

19
00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:47.315
"You stomped on my toes!"

20
00:01:47.315 --> 00:01:50.269
"Sorry," said the king.

21
00:01:50.269 --> 00:01:52.352
He rubbed his eyes.

22
00:01:52.353 --> 00:01:56.389
"I'm not getting any sleep!" he moaned.

23
00:01:56.389 --> 00:01:59.837
The queen rubbed her sore toes.

24
00:01:59.837 --> 00:02:03.880
"This must stop," she said.

25
00:02:03.881 --> 00:02:07.209
Then the queen snapped her fingers.

26
00:02:07.209 --> 00:02:10.038
"I know what to do!"

27
00:02:10.038 --> 00:02:15.738
"Please! Don't sing again!" the king begged.

28
00:02:15.738 --> 00:02:18.277
The queen glared at him.

29
00:02:18.277 --> 00:02:21.663
"Here's what we'll do," she said.

30
00:02:21.663 --> 00:02:24.335
She whispered in his ear.

31
00:02:24.335 --> 00:02:26.518
The king nodded.

32
00:02:26.518 --> 00:02:30.887
"All will be well now!" the queen said.

33
00:02:30.887 --> 00:02:33.838
But all was not well.

34
00:02:33.838 --> 00:02:39.030
Someone was listening.
